# The floor lever (#413): a 3/4 wooden block standing on the ground, an iron handle in a slot in its top, the red knob.
# Frame "on" (handle leaning right) is frame 0, frame "off" (handle leaning left) is frame 1: the SpriteSheets.LEVER order.
# The base (rows 10-15) and the pivot (cols 7-8) are identical in both frames; row 15 rests on the floor line. The light
# comes from the upper left in both frames, so "off" is drawn, not mirrored.
